<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <link rel="apple-touch-icon" sizes="180x180" href="/apple-touch-icon.png">
<link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="32x32" href="/favicon-32x32.png">
<link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="16x16" href="/favicon-16x16.png">
<link rel="icon" href="/favicon.ico">

    <title>About Me | <%= name %> <%= surname %></title>
</head>
<body class="bg-gray-50 text-gray-900 font-sans min-h-screen selection:bg-sky-500 selection:text-white">
    
    <!-- Navigation Include -->
    <%- include('nav', { name: name, surname: surname, img: img }) %>

    <!-- Main Content Container -->
    <main class="container mx-auto px-6 py-16 max-w-4xl">
        
        <!-- Profile Header Section -->
        <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center gap-8 mb-16 bg-white p-8 rounded-3xl shadow-sm border border-gray-100">
            
            <!-- Profile Picture -->
            <div class="flex-shrink-0">
                    <img src="/99619384.jpg" alt="Zaid Osama" class="w-40 h-40 rounded-full border-4 border-sky-100 object-cover shadow-lg">
        
            </div>

            <!-- Intro & Socials -->
            <div class="text-center md:text-left flex-1">
                <h1 class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-gray-950 mb-2">Hi, I'm Zaid Osama 👋</h1>
                <h2 class="text-xl text-sky-600 font-medium mb-4">Junior Software Developer & Engineering Student</h2>
                <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-6">
                    I've been deeply passionate about programming since 2022. I spent a lot of time teaching myself the basics, but now that it's officially my field of study, I finally get to explore my passion thoroughly and turn my ideas into actual software.
                </p>
                
                <!-- Social Links -->
                <div class="flex items-center justify-center md:justify-start gap-4">
                    <!-- GitHub Button -->
                    <a href="https://github.com/ORANG-H" target="_blank" class="flex items-center gap-2 bg-gray-900 hover:bg-gray-800 text-white px-5 py-2.5 rounded-lg transition-colors text-sm font-medium shadow-sm">
                        <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M12 2C6.477 2 2 6.484 2 12.017c0 4.425 2.865 8.18 6.839 9.504.5.092.682-.217.682-.483 0-.237-.008-.868-.013-1.703-2.782.605-3.369-1.343-3.369-1.343-.454-1.158-1.11-1.466-1.11-1.466-.908-.62.069-.608.069-.608 1.003.07 1.531 1.032 1.531 1.032.892 1.53 2.341 1.088 2.91.832.092-.647.35-1.088.636-1.338-2.22-.253-4.555-1.113-4.555-4.951 0-1.093.39-1.988 1.029-2.688-.103-.253-.446-1.272.098-2.65 0 0 .84-.27 2.75 1.026A9.564 9.564 0 0112 6.844c.85.004 1.705.115 2.504.337 1.909-1.296 2.747-1.027 2.747-1.027.546 1.379.202 2.398.1 2.651.64.7 1.028 1.595 1.028 2.688 0 3.848-2.339 4.695-4.566 4.943.359.309.678.92.678 1.855 0 1.338-.012 2.419-.012 2.747 0 .268.18.58.688.482A10.019 10.019 0 0022 12.017C22 6.484 17.522 2 12 2z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg>
                        GitHub
                    </a>
                    <!-- LinkedIn Button -->
                    <a href="https://linkedin.com/in/zaid-osamah" target="_blank" class="flex items-center gap-2 bg-[#0077b5] hover:bg-[#005e93] text-white px-5 py-2.5 rounded-lg transition-colors text-sm font-medium shadow-sm">
                        <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M19 0h-14c-2.761 0-5 2.239-5 5v14c0 2.761 2.239 5 5 5h14c2.762 0 5-2.239 5-5v-14c0-2.761-2.238-5-5-5zm-11 19h-3v-11h3v11zm-1.5-12.268c-.966 0-1.75-.79-1.75-1.764s.784-1.764 1.75-1.764 1.75.79 1.75 1.764-.783 1.764-1.75 1.764zm13.5 12.268h-3v-5.604c0-3.368-4-3.113-4 0v5.604h-3v-11h3v1.765c1.396-2.586 7-2.777 7 2.476v6.759z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg>
                        LinkedIn
                    </a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- The Journey Section -->
        <div class="mb-12">
            <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4 border-b pb-2">My Journey</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4">
                I am currently a third-year Computer Engineering student at Istanbul Aydın University, studying on a full academic scholarship. Being fluent in Arabic, English, and Turkish has helped me collaborate with diverse peers, and I'm currently dedicating time to learning German to expand my horizons.
            </p>
            <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
                My tech stack includes HTML, CSS, JavaScript, React, Node.js, TypeScript, Vite, and PostgreSQL/MySQL. I love building things from scratch to truly understand how they work beneath the surface.
            </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Projects Section -->
        <div>
            <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6 border-b pb-2">What I've Built</h3>
            
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
                
                <!-- Project 1 -->
                <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-xl border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow">
                    <h4 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Full-Stack Capstone Blog</h4>
                    <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm mb-4">
                        A responsive web application built with Node.js, Express.js, and EJS templates, integrated with a PostgreSQL database. I configured the routing architecture and local database system using pgAdmin 4 to handle dynamic content.
                    </p>
                    <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 mt-auto">
                        <span class="px-2 py-1 bg-sky-50 text-sky-700 rounded text-xs font-semibold">Node.js</span>
                        <span class="px-2 py-1 bg-sky-50 text-sky-700 rounded text-xs font-semibold">Express</span>
                        <span class="px-2 py-1 bg-sky-50 text-sky-700 rounded text-xs font-semibold">PostgreSQL</span>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Project 2 -->
                <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-xl border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow">
                    <h4 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Modern Front-End Apps</h4>
                    <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm mb-4">
                        I've developed several front-end projects to sharpen my UI/UX and logic skills, including a robust Weather Dashboard and a custom TypeScript project utilizing Vite for rapid development.
                    </p>
                    <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 mt-auto">
                        <span class="px-2 py-1 bg-sky-50 text-sky-700 rounded text-xs font-semibold">TypeScript</span>
                        <span class="px-2 py-1 bg-sky-50 text-sky-700 rounded text-xs font-semibold">React</span>
                        <span class="px-2 py-1 bg-sky-50 text-sky-700 rounded text-xs font-semibold">Vite</span>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Project 3 -->
                <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-xl border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow">
                    <h4 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Creative Web Experiences</h4>
                    <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm mb-4">
                        I enjoy injecting creativity into code. I designed a custom digital Valentine's Day interactive web project featuring a retro pixel art theme, as well as a personalized birthday website from scratch.
                    </p>
                    <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 mt-auto">
                        <span class="px-2 py-1 bg-sky-50 text-sky-700 rounded text-xs font-semibold">HTML/CSS</span>
                        <span class="px-2 py-1 bg-sky-50 text-sky-700 rounded text-xs font-semibold">JavaScript</span>
                        <span class="px-2 py-1 bg-sky-50 text-sky-700 rounded text-xs font-semibold">UI Design</span>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Project 4 -->
                <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-xl border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow">
                    <h4 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Hardware Automation (IoT)</h4>
                    <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm mb-4">
                        Currently branching into embedded systems. I'm planning an automated plant hydration system utilizing an ESP32 microcontroller, moisture sensors, and a water pump, complete with Wi-Fi data transmission.
                    </p>
                    <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 mt-auto">
                        <span class="px-2 py-1 bg-sky-50 text-sky-700 rounded text-xs font-semibold">C++</span>
                        <span class="px-2 py-1 bg-sky-50 text-sky-700 rounded text-xs font-semibold">ESP32</span>
                        <span class="px-2 py-1 bg-sky-50 text-sky-700 rounded text-xs font-semibold">IoT</span>
                    </div>
                </div>

            </div>
        </div>

    </main>
</body>
</html>